## 2. Color System

The anchor is **Moody Forest** — a muted olive-sage. All other colors are tuned to sit in harmony with it (same desaturation level, warm undertones).

### Core palette

| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--sage-900` | `#3E4A2E` | Headlines on light, icon-active |
| `--sage-700` | `#6B7A4F` | Primary text, buttons |
| `--sage-500` | `#9CA57A` | **Moody Forest — brand anchor** |
| `--sage-300` | `#C5CBA8` | Hover states, dividers |
| `--sage-100` | `#E8EBD6` | Selected chips, soft backgrounds |
| `--sage-50`  | `#F4F5E9` | Subtle fills |

### Neutrals (warm, never cool)

| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--linen-50`  | `#FAF7F1` | **App background** |
| `--linen-100` | `#F2ECE0` | Card surface |
| `--linen-200` | `#E6DDCB` | Card border, inputs |
| `--ink-900`   | `#2A2823` | Body text on light |
| `--ink-600`   | `#6B665C` | Secondary text |
| `--ink-400`   | `#A8A193` | Tertiary text, placeholders |

### Accents (used sparingly — one per screen, max)

| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--peach` | `#E8B59C` | Milestones, celebrations |
| `--butter` | `#E8D191` | Sleep, night-mode highlights |
| `--clay` | `#C08775` | Allergy alerts, warnings |
| `--dusk` | `#8FA3B8` | Health/medical data tags |

### Semantic

| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--success` | `#7A9459` | deeper sage, not kelly green |
| `--warning` | `#D4A574` | warm ochre, not yellow |
| `--danger` | `#B85C4C` | terracotta, not crimson |
| `--info` | `#7A91A8` | dusk blue |

### Rules
- **70 / 25 / 5**: 70% linen neutrals, 25% sage family, 5% accent.
- Never place sage-500 on linen-50 for text — contrast fails. Text uses sage-700 or sage-900.
- Accent colors never fill large areas. They are for icons, tags, small dots, and celebration moments.
- A dark mode should exist: invert to `--ink-900` backgrounds with sage-300 text; retain warm undertones (no pure black, no cool grey).

