## 6. Components

### Buttons
- **Primary**: `--sage-700` fill, linen text, pill radius, 48px height, Nunito 700, subtle press-scale to 0.97.
- **Secondary**: transparent, 1.5px sage-500 border, sage-700 text.
- **Ghost**: no border, sage-700 text, sage-100 background on hover.
- **Destructive**: clay-colored outline, only used for deletes.

All buttons have a 200ms ease-out transition and a `focus-visible` ring using `--shadow-focus`.

### Inputs
- 52px tall on mobile (generous for thumb typing).
- `--linen-100` fill, 1px `--linen-200` border that darkens to `--sage-500` on focus.
- Label sits _above_ the field, never inside — floating labels are a usability trap for one-handed use.
- Optional helper text in `--ink-600` beneath.

### Cards (the core atom)
- `--linen-100` background, 1px `--linen-200` border, 20px radius, 20px padding.
- Title in Nunito 700. Timestamp in Nunito 600 `--ink-400` micro-caps, top-right.
- Tap anywhere on the card to expand/edit. No tiny buttons inside cards.

### Chips & tags (food, allergens, moods)
- Pill radius, sage-100 fill, sage-900 text, 11px caption, optional 14px leading icon.
- Selected state: sage-500 fill, linen-50 text.
- Allergen chips always use `--clay` coloring to stand out from regular tags.

### Navigation
- **Mobile**: bottom tab bar, 5 items max, filled icon + label on active. Active background is a sage-100 pill that morphs between tabs (Motion layoutId animation).
- **Desktop**: left sidebar with the baby's name and avatar pinned at top.

### Floating Action Button
- Single FAB bottom-right on the timeline screen, 56px, `--sage-700` fill, plus icon. Expands on tap into a radial menu of quick log actions (feed, nap, diaper, note) with staggered 40ms delays.

### Empty states
Always illustrated. Example copy: _"No notes yet. Your first observation is waiting."_

### Toasts
Slide up from bottom, linen-100 fill, sage-500 left accent bar, auto-dismiss 3s with a progress underline. Swipe down to dismiss.

